            <section ID="L8aefd78b-17a5-4101-bddd-73a4e362fbcc">
               <id root="4d4fe7f6-92ae-f80e-e063-6394a90ae3bb"/>
               <code code="34089-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DESCRIPTION SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">DESCRIPTION:</content>Pramosone 
  <sup>®</sup>Ointment is a topical preparation containing hydrocortisone acetate 1% w/w or 2.5% w/w and pramoxine hydrochloride 1% w/w in an emollient ointment base containing sorbitan sesquioleate, purified water, Aquaphor 
  <sup>®</sup>, and white petrolatum.
 </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Topical corticosteroids are anti-inflammatory and anti-pruritic agents. The structural formula, the chemical name, molecular formula and molecular weight for active ingredients are presented below.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <renderMultiMedia referencedObject="Leb746b7a-cd32-44b6-94d5-2430c1747a14"/>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>hydrocortisone acetate</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Pregn-4-ene-3,20-dione, 21-(acetyloxy)-11,17-dihydroxy-, (11-beta)-</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>C 
  <sub>23</sub>H 
  <sub>32</sub>O 
  <sub>6</sub>; mol. wt: 404.50
 </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <renderMultiMedia referencedObject="Ldad7eea1-83f1-4766-9d0f-134eaf84b21b"/>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>pramoxine hydrochloride</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>4-(3-(p-butoxyphenoxy)propyl)morpholine hydrochloride</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>C 
  <sub>17</sub>H 
  <sub>27</sub>NO 
  <sub>3</sub>.HCl: mol. wt: 329.87
 </paragraph>
                  <paragraph/>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260318"/>
               <component>
                  <observationMedia ID="Leb746b7a-cd32-44b6-94d5-2430c1747a14">
